{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>and they covet</b>, <b>and they seize</b> — by force." "<b>and they lift</b> — and they take for themselves." "<b>and they oppress</b> — by way of enticement and deception and fraud, for one who oppresses his fellow resembles a guarantor and takes hold of his property that he lent him, or of his wage that he hired him for."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:40.895762777Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}